Copyright 2026 Nyquis

This repository is a patch recipe for the Android client of Terra Battle, which
you must supply yourself. It contains only the patcher, its declarative patch
data, and the documentation; it contains no game code beyond the minimal
instruction deltas required to locate and verify each patch site (67 sites,
156 non-zero bytes, at most 4 bytes each).

Terra Battle and all of its assets are Copyright Mistwalker. They are not
included here and are not licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No
patched client, and no copy of the game APK or its assets, may be distributed
from this repository.

Third-party components are referenced at build time but not included:

  apktool 3.0.3                Apache License 2.0   https://apktool.org
  Android SDK Build-Tools      Apache License 2.0   zipalign, apksigner, aapt2
  OpenJDK (via pixi)           GPL v2 + Classpath Exception
  capstone                     BSD 3-Clause
  UnityPy                      see its distribution metadata
  Python packages              resolved and pinned by pixi.lock

The tooling expects the apktool jar at ../../.tools/rea/bin/apktool_3.0.3.jar
by default; set APKTOOL_JAR to point at your own copy. Its SHA-256 is pinned in
patches/smali.json and verified by `pixi run doctor`.
